{
  "episode": "ep05",
  "title": "足利尊氏と戦国の始まり",
  "gaps": {
    "beat": 0.3,
    "scene": 0.6,
    "section": 0.8,
    "tail": 0.6
  },
  "total_duration": 521.844,
  "scenes": [
    {
      "id": "s01",
      "section": "opening",
      "start": 0.0,
      "beats": [
        {
          "speaker": "manabu",
          "wav": "narration/s01_b00.wav",
          "start": 0.0,
          "duration": 5.611,
          "text": "ねえ先生、家来が主を倒す「下剋上」って、本当にあるの？"
        },
        {
          "speaker": "sensei",
          "wav": "narration/s01_b01.wav",
          "start": 5.911,
          "duration": 6.624,
          "text": "実は、あるんです!足利尊氏の室町幕府から応仁の大乱まで、栄華と大乱を順番に見ていきましょう。"
        },
        {
          "speaker": "manabu",
          "wav": "narration/s01_b02.wav",
          "start": 12.835,
          "duration": 5.76,
          "text": "その理由、早く知りたいのだ!金閣も銀閣も応仁の乱も、ぜんぶ見るのだ!"
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "id": "s02",
      "section": "story",
      "start": 19.395,
      "beats": [
        {
          "speaker": "manabu",
          "wav": "narration/s02_b00.wav",
          "start": 19.395,
          "duration": 2.528,
          "text": "鎌倉幕府、元気だったのだ?"
        },
        {
          "speaker": "sensei",
          "wav": "narration/s02_b01.wav",
          "start": 22.223,
          "duration": 3.435,
          "text": "いいえ、元寇の後は不満だらけ。"
        },
        {
          "speaker": "sensei",
          "wav": "narration/s02_b02.wav",
          "start": 25.957,
          "duration": 5.163,
          "text": "後醍醐天皇は、政治を取り戻そうと討幕の計画を進めます。"
        },
        {
          "speaker": "manabu",
          "wav": "narration/s02_b03.wav",
          "start": 31.42,
          "duration": 1.76,
          "text": "天皇が立ち上がるのだ!?"
        },
        {
          "speaker": "sensei",
          "wav": "narration/s02_b04.wav",
          "start": 33.48,
          "duration": 3.925,
          "text": "河内の武将・楠木正成が少人数で鎌倉軍を悩ませ、"
        },
        {
          "speaker": "sensei",
          "wav": "narration/s02_b05.wav",
          "start": 37.705,
          "duration": 9.067,
          "text": "新田義貞が鎌倉を攻め落としました。"
        },
        {
          "speaker": "sensei",
          "wav": "narration/s02_b06.wav",
          "start": 47.072,
          "duration": 3.189,
          "text": "1333年、鎌倉幕府滅亡です。"
        },
        {
          "speaker": "manabu",
          "wav": "narration/s02_b07.wav",
          "start": 50.561,
          "duration": 3.605,
          "text": "楠木さんは、少人数でも強かった名将なのだ!"
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "id": "s03",
      "section": "story",
      "start": 54.767,
      "beats": [
        {
          "speaker": "manabu",
          "wav": "narration/s03_b00.wav",
          "start": 54.767,
          "duration": 2.709,
          "text": "では、天皇の政治が始まるのだ?"
        },
        {
          "speaker": "sensei",
          "wav": "narration/s03_b01.wav",
          "start": 57.776,
          "duration": 2.816,
          "text": "後醍醐天皇の親政、建武の新政です。"
        },
        {
          "speaker": "sensei",
          "wav": "narration/s03_b02.wav",
          "start": 60.892,
          "duration": 3.093,
          "text": "公家中心の政治で、武士の希望は薄く、"
        },
        {
          "speaker": "sensei",
          "wav": "narration/s03_b03.wav",
          "start": 64.285,
          "duration": 2.027,
          "text": "恩賞も思うように配れませんでした。"
        },
        {
          "speaker": "manabu",
          "wav": "narration/s03_b04.wav",
          "start": 66.612,
          "duration": 3.829,
          "text": "建武の新政って、新しいお寺を作る政治なのだ?"
        },
        {
          "speaker": "sensei",
          "wav": "narration/s03_b05.wav",
          "start": 70.741,
          "duration": 2.603,
          "text": "いいえ、新しい政治のかたちのことです。"
        },
        {
          "speaker": "sensei",
          "wav": "narration/s03_b06.wav",
          "start": 73.644,
          "duration": 3.36,
          "text": "武士が期待したのに、希望は薄くてがっかりさせちゃったんです。"
        },
        {
          "speaker": "manabu",
          "wav": "narration/s03_b07.wav",
          "start": 77.304,
          "duration": 1.941,
          "text": "武士は、がっかりなのだ?"
        },
        {
          "speaker": "sensei",
          "wav": "narration/s03_b08.wav",
          "start": 79.545,
          "duration": 3.061,
          "text": "ええ、たった3年足らずで武士の心は離れ、"
        },
        {
          "speaker": "sensei",
          "wav": "narration/s03_b09.wav",
          "start": 82.907,
          "duration": 1.6,
          "text": "政治は行き詰まっていきます。"
        },
        {
          "speaker": "manabu",
          "wav": "narration/s03_b10.wav",
          "start": 84.807,
          "duration": 2.475,
          "text": "ガッカリ政治、続かないなのだ…"
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "id": "s04",
      "section": "story",
      "start": 87.881,
      "beats": [
        {
          "speaker": "manabu",
          "wav": "narration/s04_b00.wav",
          "start": 87.881,
          "duration": 2.197,
          "text": "そこで立ったのは、だれなのだ?"
        },
        {
          "speaker": "sensei",
          "wav": "narration/s04_b01.wav",
          "start": 90.379,
          "duration": 1.461,
          "text": "足利尊氏です。"
        },
        {
          "speaker": "sensei",
          "wav": "narration/s04_b02.wav",
          "start": 92.14,
          "duration": 7.243,
          "text": "武士の心を集め、1336年に京都を抑えて新しい政治を始めます。"
        },
        {
          "speaker": "sensei",
          "wav": "narration/s04_b03.wav",
          "start": 99.683,
          "duration": 6.272,
          "text": "楠木正成は、湊川で最後まで天皇側として戦い、討ち死にしました。"
        },
        {
          "speaker": "manabu",
          "wav": "narration/s04_b04.wav",
          "start": 106.255,
          "duration": 2.357,
          "text": "楠木さん…かっこよすぎるのだ…"
        },
        {
          "speaker": "sensei",
          "wav": "narration/s04_b05.wav",
          "start": 108.912,
          "duration": 6.635,
          "text": "1338年、尊氏は征夷大将軍に就任して、室町幕府を開きます。"
        },
        {
          "speaker": "sensei",
          "wav": "narration/s04_b06.wav",
          "start": 115.847,
          "duration": 4.928,
          "text": "政治の拠点は京都で、武家の朝廷みたいなものでした。"
        },
        {
          "speaker": "manabu",
          "wav": "narration/s04_b07.wav",
          "start": 121.075,
          "duration": 1.664,
          "text": "幕府が京都に来たのだ!"
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "id": "s05",
      "section": "story",
      "start": 123.339,
      "beats": [
        {
          "speaker": "manabu",
          "wav": "narration/s05_b00.wav",
          "start": 123.339,
          "duration": 2.955,
          "text": "でも、天皇側は、おしまいなのだ?"
        },
        {
          "speaker": "sensei",
          "wav": "narration/s05_b01.wav",
          "start": 126.593,
          "duration": 4.427,
          "text": "いいえ、後醍醐は吉野に逃れて朝廷を開きます。"
        },
        {
          "speaker": "sensei",
          "wav": "narration/s05_b02.wav",
          "start": 131.32,
          "duration": 6.592,
          "text": "京都の北朝と吉野の南朝が、約56年も対立する南北朝時代です。"
        },
        {
          "speaker": "manabu",
          "wav": "narration/s05_b03.wav",
          "start": 138.212,
          "duration": 2.496,
          "text": "天皇が二人!?大もめなのだ!"
        },
        {
          "speaker": "sensei",
          "wav": "narration/s05_b04.wav",
          "start": 141.008,
          "duration": 3.947,
          "text": "ええ、争いは長く続きましたが、1392年、"
        },
        {
          "speaker": "sensei",
          "wav": "narration/s05_b05.wav",
          "start": 145.255,
          "duration": 2.539,
          "text": "義満の手でついに南北朝が合一します。"
        },
        {
          "speaker": "manabu",
          "wav": "narration/s05_b06.wav",
          "start": 148.093,
          "duration": 2.699,
          "text": "56年…も、ながいなのだ…"
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "id": "s06",
      "section": "story",
      "start": 151.392,
      "beats": [
        {
          "speaker": "manabu",
          "wav": "narration/s06_b00.wav",
          "start": 151.392,
          "duration": 2.389,
          "text": "義満って、すごい人なのだ?"
        },
        {
          "speaker": "sensei",
          "wav": "narration/s06_b01.wav",
          "start": 154.081,
          "duration": 6.997,
          "text": "足利義満は、若くして家を継ぎ、将軍の力をどこまでも強くしました。"
        },
        {
          "speaker": "sensei",
          "wav": "narration/s06_b02.wav",
          "start": 161.379,
          "duration": 4.704,
          "text": "朝廷の官まで極める、前例のない武家です。"
        },
        {
          "speaker": "manabu",
          "wav": "narration/s06_b03.wav",
          "start": 166.383,
          "duration": 1.973,
          "text": "武士が、公家を超えるのだ!?"
        },
        {
          "speaker": "sensei",
          "wav": "narration/s06_b04.wav",
          "start": 168.656,
          "duration": 6.699,
          "text": "ええ、守護大名たちも義満に従い、幕府の力は頂点に達しました。"
        },
        {
          "speaker": "sensei",
          "wav": "narration/s06_b05.wav",
          "start": 175.655,
          "duration": 2.859,
          "text": "天皇も、義満には逆らえませんでした。"
        },
        {
          "speaker": "manabu",
          "wav": "narration/s06_b06.wav",
          "start": 178.813,
          "duration": 2.283,
          "text": "将軍、トップオブトップなのだ!"
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "id": "s07",
      "section": "story",
      "start": 181.696,
      "beats": [
        {
          "speaker": "manabu",
          "wav": "narration/s07_b00.wav",
          "start": 181.696,
          "duration": 1.707,
          "text": "お金の話もあるのだ?"
        },
        {
          "speaker": "sensei",
          "wav": "narration/s07_b01.wav",
          "start": 183.703,
          "duration": 4.288,
          "text": "ええ、義満は明と日明貿易を始めます。"
        },
        {
          "speaker": "sensei",
          "wav": "narration/s07_b02.wav",
          "start": 188.291,
          "duration": 5.376,
          "text": "海賊の倭寇を取り締まる代わりに、貿易の権利をもらいました。"
        },
        {
          "speaker": "manabu",
          "wav": "narration/s07_b03.wav",
          "start": 193.967,
          "duration": 2.56,
          "text": "倭寇って、海のならず者なのだ?"
        },
        {
          "speaker": "sensei",
          "wav": "narration/s07_b04.wav",
          "start": 196.827,
          "duration": 4.555,
          "text": "そう、勘合符を持つ船だけが許される貿易です。"
        },
        {
          "speaker": "sensei",
          "wav": "narration/s07_b05.wav",
          "start": 201.681,
          "duration": 4.725,
          "text": "中国の銅銭や絹が入って、幕府は大もうけしました。"
        },
        {
          "speaker": "manabu",
          "wav": "narration/s07_b06.wav",
          "start": 206.707,
          "duration": 2.101,
          "text": "海の商売、キャッシュなのだ!"
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "id": "s08",
      "section": "story",
      "start": 209.408,
      "beats": [
        {
          "speaker": "manabu",
          "wav": "narration/s08_b00.wav",
          "start": 209.408,
          "duration": 2.56,
          "text": "そのお金で、建てたものがあるのだ!?"
        },
        {
          "speaker": "sensei",
          "wav": "narration/s08_b01.wav",
          "start": 212.268,
          "duration": 1.344,
          "text": "それ、金閣です。"
        },
        {
          "speaker": "sensei",
          "wav": "narration/s08_b02.wav",
          "start": 213.912,
          "duration": 1.344,
          "text": "1397年に義満が建てた、"
        },
        {
          "speaker": "sensei",
          "wav": "narration/s08_b03.wav",
          "start": 215.556,
          "duration": 3.157,
          "text": "山吹色に輝く別荘で、死後は寺になりました。"
        },
        {
          "speaker": "manabu",
          "wav": "narration/s08_b04.wav",
          "start": 219.013,
          "duration": 2.848,
          "text": "金ピカの家なのだ!?うらやましいのだ!"
        },
        {
          "speaker": "sensei",
          "wav": "narration/s08_b05.wav",
          "start": 222.161,
          "duration": 2.123,
          "text": "ここで公家文化と武家文化が混ざり合い、"
        },
        {
          "speaker": "sensei",
          "wav": "narration/s08_b06.wav",
          "start": 224.584,
          "duration": 5.739,
          "text": "華麗な北山文化が咲きました。"
        },
        {
          "speaker": "sensei",
          "wav": "narration/s08_b07.wav",
          "start": 230.623,
          "duration": 1.504,
          "text": "金閣はそのシンボルです。"
        },
        {
          "speaker": "manabu",
          "wav": "narration/s08_b08.wav",
          "start": 232.427,
          "duration": 1.547,
          "text": "文化もゴージャスなのだ!"
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "id": "s09",
      "section": "story",
      "start": 234.573,
      "beats": [
        {
          "speaker": "manabu",
          "wav": "narration/s09_b00.wav",
          "start": 234.573,
          "duration": 2.144,
          "text": "でも、栄華は続くのだ?"
        },
        {
          "speaker": "sensei",
          "wav": "narration/s09_b01.wav",
          "start": 237.017,
          "duration": 4.267,
          "text": "義満の後は、幕府の力がじわじわ下がります。"
        },
        {
          "speaker": "sensei",
          "wav": "narration/s09_b02.wav",
          "start": 241.584,
          "duration": 6.091,
          "text": "1467年、細川氏と山名氏の争いから、応仁の乱が始まります。"
        },
        {
          "speaker": "manabu",
          "wav": "narration/s09_b03.wav",
          "start": 247.975,
          "duration": 2.347,
          "text": "大名同士の、けんかなのだ!?"
        },
        {
          "speaker": "sensei",
          "wav": "narration/s09_b04.wav",
          "start": 250.621,
          "duration": 5.152,
          "text": "東軍と西軍に分れ、戦は11年続きました。"
        },
        {
          "speaker": "sensei",
          "wav": "narration/s09_b05.wav",
          "start": 256.073,
          "duration": 5.173,
          "text": "京都は焼け野原になり、権威も地盤も大きく揺らぎます。"
        },
        {
          "speaker": "manabu",
          "wav": "narration/s09_b06.wav",
          "start": 261.547,
          "duration": 2.197,
          "text": "金色が、灰色になるのだ…"
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "id": "s10",
      "section": "story",
      "start": 264.344,
      "beats": [
        {
          "speaker": "manabu",
          "wav": "narration/s10_b00.wav",
          "start": 264.344,
          "duration": 2.667,
          "text": "乱のあと、日本はどうなったのだ?"
        },
        {
          "speaker": "sensei",
          "wav": "narration/s10_b01.wav",
          "start": 267.311,
          "duration": 3.221,
          "text": "守護たちは、国を自分の国のように支配し始めます。"
        },
        {
          "speaker": "sensei",
          "wav": "narration/s10_b02.wav",
          "start": 270.832,
          "duration": 3.403,
          "text": "これが分国支配で、国ごとの大きな勢力が育ちます。"
        },
        {
          "speaker": "sensei",
          "wav": "narration/s10_b03.wav",
          "start": 274.535,
          "duration": 4.949,
          "text": "奈良や平安は都から全国を動かしたけれど、"
        },
        {
          "speaker": "sensei",
          "wav": "narration/s10_b04.wav",
          "start": 279.784,
          "duration": 2.677,
          "text": "この時代は各地のボスが自分の国を治めます。"
        },
        {
          "speaker": "manabu",
          "wav": "narration/s10_b05.wav",
          "start": 282.761,
          "duration": 2.261,
          "text": "国ごとに、ボスができるのだ!?"
        },
        {
          "speaker": "sensei",
          "wav": "narration/s10_b06.wav",
          "start": 285.323,
          "duration": 5.696,
          "text": "ええ、守護や国人が土地の武士を従え、領国を治めます。"
        },
        {
          "speaker": "sensei",
          "wav": "narration/s10_b07.wav",
          "start": 291.319,
          "duration": 3.989,
          "text": "遠い京都の将軍は、もう手が届きません。"
        },
        {
          "speaker": "manabu",
          "wav": "narration/s10_b08.wav",
          "start": 295.608,
          "duration": 2.581,
          "text": "遠くのボスより、近くのボスなのだ!"
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "id": "s11",
      "section": "story",
      "start": 298.789,
      "beats": [
        {
          "speaker": "manabu",
          "wav": "narration/s11_b00.wav",
          "start": 298.789,
          "duration": 2.379,
          "text": "下剋上って、いつからなのだ?"
        },
        {
          "speaker": "sensei",
          "wav": "narration/s11_b01.wav",
          "start": 301.468,
          "duration": 3.019,
          "text": "応仁の乱の前から芽が出ています。"
        },
        {
          "speaker": "sensei",
          "wav": "narration/s11_b02.wav",
          "start": 304.787,
          "duration": 5.589,
          "text": "守護代や国人が、主君を押さえて力を伸ばし始めたんです。"
        },
        {
          "speaker": "manabu",
          "wav": "narration/s11_b03.wav",
          "start": 310.676,
          "duration": 2.187,
          "text": "家来が、主を超えるのだ!?"
        },
        {
          "speaker": "sensei",
          "wav": "narration/s11_b04.wav",
          "start": 313.163,
          "duration": 0.725,
          "text": "そのとおり。"
        },
        {
          "speaker": "sensei",
          "wav": "narration/s11_b05.wav",
          "start": 314.188,
          "duration": 4.096,
          "text": "のちに「下剋上」と呼ばれる、大逆転の世の入口なんです。"
        },
        {
          "speaker": "manabu",
          "wav": "narration/s11_b06.wav",
          "start": 318.584,
          "duration": 2.997,
          "text": "ドン底からナンバーワン、可能性なのだ!"
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "id": "s12",
      "section": "story",
      "start": 322.181,
      "beats": [
        {
          "speaker": "manabu",
          "wav": "narration/s12_b00.wav",
          "start": 322.181,
          "duration": 2.773,
          "text": "乱世のとき、文化はどうなるのだ?"
        },
        {
          "speaker": "sensei",
          "wav": "narration/s12_b01.wav",
          "start": 325.255,
          "duration": 5.419,
          "text": "応仁の乱の後、足利義政が山里に銀閣を建てます。"
        },
        {
          "speaker": "sensei",
          "wav": "narration/s12_b02.wav",
          "start": 330.973,
          "duration": 5.461,
          "text": "金色でなく銀色、しっとりひなびた美の文化、東山文化です。"
        },
        {
          "speaker": "manabu",
          "wav": "narration/s12_b03.wav",
          "start": 336.735,
          "duration": 3.008,
          "text": "金閣とおとなしい銀閣、親子なのだ!?"
        },
        {
          "speaker": "sensei",
          "wav": "narration/s12_b04.wav",
          "start": 340.043,
          "duration": 4.64,
          "text": "茶の湯や生け花、枯山水の庭も、このころに育ちます。"
        },
        {
          "speaker": "sensei",
          "wav": "narration/s12_b05.wav",
          "start": 344.983,
          "duration": 4.064,
          "text": "乱世だからこそ、心静かな美が求められたんですよ。"
        },
        {
          "speaker": "manabu",
          "wav": "narration/s12_b06.wav",
          "start": 349.347,
          "duration": 2.069,
          "text": "しずかな美、たまらないのだ。"
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "id": "s13",
      "section": "story",
      "start": 352.016,
      "beats": [
        {
          "speaker": "manabu",
          "wav": "narration/s13_b00.wav",
          "start": 352.016,
          "duration": 2.688,
          "text": "そして、乱世の主役はだれなのだ?"
        },
        {
          "speaker": "sensei",
          "wav": "narration/s13_b01.wav",
          "start": 355.004,
          "duration": 4.512,
          "text": "下剋上をくり返した結果、戦国大名の登場です。"
        },
        {
          "speaker": "sensei",
          "wav": "narration/s13_b02.wav",
          "start": 359.816,
          "duration": 4.395,
          "text": "家臣団を率いて、自分の国を力で治めます。"
        },
        {
          "speaker": "manabu",
          "wav": "narration/s13_b03.wav",
          "start": 364.511,
          "duration": 1.867,
          "text": "地元のスーパースターなのだ!"
        },
        {
          "speaker": "sensei",
          "wav": "narration/s13_b04.wav",
          "start": 366.677,
          "duration": 3.851,
          "text": "ええ、この乱世を終わらせる英雄が、まもなく登場します。"
        },
        {
          "speaker": "sensei",
          "wav": "narration/s13_b05.wav",
          "start": 370.828,
          "duration": 1.504,
          "text": "名前は、織田信長!"
        },
        {
          "speaker": "manabu",
          "wav": "narration/s13_b06.wav",
          "start": 372.632,
          "duration": 2.325,
          "text": "信長!?つづきが気になるのだ!"
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "id": "s14",
      "section": "points",
      "start": 375.757,
      "beats": [
        {
          "speaker": "sensei",
          "wav": "narration/s14_b00.wav",
          "start": 375.757,
          "duration": 3.552,
          "text": "ここから受験ポイントのまとめ!まずは、室町の成り立ち。"
        },
        {
          "speaker": "sensei",
          "wav": "narration/s14_b01.wav",
          "start": 379.609,
          "duration": 8.16,
          "text": "1333年鎌倉滅亡と建武の新政、1338年足利尊氏が室町幕府、"
        },
        {
          "speaker": "sensei",
          "wav": "narration/s14_b02.wav",
          "start": 388.069,
          "duration": 4.608,
          "text": "南北朝は約56年で1392年合一。"
        },
        {
          "speaker": "sensei",
          "wav": "narration/s14_b03.wav",
          "start": 392.977,
          "duration": 3.072,
          "text": "楠木正成の忠義もセットです!"
        },
        {
          "speaker": "sensei",
          "wav": "narration/s14_b04.wav",
          "start": 396.349,
          "duration": 6.165,
          "text": "「義満=日明貿易と金閣」「尊氏=室町幕府1338年」のペアも、"
        },
        {
          "speaker": "sensei",
          "wav": "narration/s14_b05.wav",
          "start": 402.815,
          "duration": 0.715,
          "text": "忘れずに。"
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "id": "s15",
      "section": "points",
      "start": 404.129,
      "beats": [
        {
          "speaker": "sensei",
          "wav": "narration/s15_b00.wav",
          "start": 404.129,
          "duration": 2.368,
          "text": "後半は、乱世と文化のまとめです。"
        },
        {
          "speaker": "sensei",
          "wav": "narration/s15_b01.wav",
          "start": 406.797,
          "duration": 4.384,
          "text": "応仁の乱1467年で戦国の始まり、"
        },
        {
          "speaker": "sensei",
          "wav": "narration/s15_b02.wav",
          "start": 411.481,
          "duration": 3.563,
          "text": "守護の分国支配、そして下剋上の芽。"
        },
        {
          "speaker": "sensei",
          "wav": "narration/s15_b03.wav",
          "start": 415.344,
          "duration": 5.152,
          "text": "文化は義満の北山文化と、義政の東山文化の対比です!"
        },
        {
          "speaker": "sensei",
          "wav": "narration/s15_b04.wav",
          "start": 420.796,
          "duration": 4.299,
          "text": "「金=北山、銀=東山」のペアで覚えましょう!"
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "id": "s16",
      "section": "quiz",
      "start": 425.895,
      "beats": [
        {
          "speaker": "sensei",
          "wav": "narration/s16_b00.wav",
          "start": 425.895,
          "duration": 2.091,
          "text": "それではクイズタイム!第一問!"
        },
        {
          "speaker": "sensei",
          "wav": "narration/s16_b01.wav",
          "start": 428.285,
          "duration": 7.115,
          "text": "1333年、鎌倉幕府を倒す力となった、"
        },
        {
          "speaker": "sensei",
          "wav": "narration/s16_b02.wav",
          "start": 435.7,
          "duration": 1.877,
          "text": "後醍醐天皇に尽くした武将は?"
        },
        {
          "speaker": "sensei",
          "wav": "narration/s16_b03.wav",
          "start": 437.877,
          "duration": 4.043,
          "text": "ア、楠木正成。イ、足利尊氏。ウ、武田信玄。"
        },
        {
          "speaker": "manabu",
          "wav": "narration/s16_b04.wav",
          "start": 442.22,
          "duration": 2.283,
          "text": "少人数の名将…アなのだ!"
        },
        {
          "speaker": "sensei",
          "wav": "narration/s16_b05.wav",
          "start": 444.803,
          "duration": 1.995,
          "text": "正解!楠木正成です。"
        },
        {
          "speaker": "sensei",
          "wav": "narration/s16_b06.wav",
          "start": 447.097,
          "duration": 3.2,
          "text": "尊氏はその後の幕府の開祖、流れで覚えましょう。"
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "id": "s17",
      "section": "quiz",
      "start": 450.897,
      "beats": [
        {
          "speaker": "sensei",
          "wav": "narration/s17_b00.wav",
          "start": 450.897,
          "duration": 0.661,
          "text": "第二問!"
        },
        {
          "speaker": "sensei",
          "wav": "narration/s17_b01.wav",
          "start": 451.859,
          "duration": 8.928,
          "text": "1467年、京都を焼け野原にして、戦国時代の入り口になった乱は?"
        },
        {
          "speaker": "sensei",
          "wav": "narration/s17_b02.wav",
          "start": 461.087,
          "duration": 4.821,
          "text": "ア、応仁の乱。イ、承久の乱。ウ、川中島の戦い。"
        },
        {
          "speaker": "manabu",
          "wav": "narration/s17_b03.wav",
          "start": 466.208,
          "duration": 2.005,
          "text": "灰色の京都…アなのだ!"
        },
        {
          "speaker": "sensei",
          "wav": "narration/s17_b04.wav",
          "start": 468.513,
          "duration": 1.728,
          "text": "正解!応仁の乱です。"
        },
        {
          "speaker": "sensei",
          "wav": "narration/s17_b05.wav",
          "start": 470.541,
          "duration": 4.053,
          "text": "1467年から11年間、この乱とセットで覚えよう。"
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "id": "s18",
      "section": "quiz",
      "start": 475.195,
      "beats": [
        {
          "speaker": "sensei",
          "wav": "narration/s18_b00.wav",
          "start": 475.195,
          "duration": 0.843,
          "text": "ラスト問題!"
        },
        {
          "speaker": "sensei",
          "wav": "narration/s18_b01.wav",
          "start": 476.337,
          "duration": 10.144,
          "text": "足利義満が明と始めた、勘合符を使う貿易は何でしょう?ア、宋貿易。"
        },
        {
          "speaker": "sensei",
          "wav": "narration/s18_b02.wav",
          "start": 486.781,
          "duration": 2.123,
          "text": "イ、日明貿易。ウ、朱印船貿易。"
        },
        {
          "speaker": "manabu",
          "wav": "narration/s18_b03.wav",
          "start": 489.204,
          "duration": 2.176,
          "text": "義満と中国…イなのだ!"
        },
        {
          "speaker": "sensei",
          "wav": "narration/s18_b04.wav",
          "start": 491.68,
          "duration": 5.771,
          "text": "正解!日明貿易です。宋貿易は平清盛、朱印船はもっと後の時代です。"
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "id": "s19",
      "section": "ending",
      "start": 498.251,
      "beats": [
        {
          "speaker": "sensei",
          "wav": "narration/s19_b00.wav",
          "start": 498.251,
          "duration": 3.381,
          "text": "今日は室町の栄華と、乱世のはじまりを見てきました。"
        },
        {
          "speaker": "manabu",
          "wav": "narration/s19_b01.wav",
          "start": 501.932,
          "duration": 5.013,
          "text": "建武の新政、南北朝、金閣、応仁の乱、下剋上…"
        },
        {
          "speaker": "manabu",
          "wav": "narration/s19_b02.wav",
          "start": 507.245,
          "duration": 2.496,
          "text": "キラキラと灰色が混ざった時代なのだ!"
        },
        {
          "speaker": "sensei",
          "wav": "narration/s19_b03.wav",
          "start": 510.041,
          "duration": 3.691,
          "text": "次回第6話は、織田信長と豊臣秀吉の天下統一。"
        },
        {
          "speaker": "sensei",
          "wav": "narration/s19_b04.wav",
          "start": 514.032,
          "duration": 2.773,
          "text": "乱世を終わらせる二人の話、お楽しみに!"
        },
        {
          "speaker": "manabu",
          "wav": "narration/s19_b05.wav",
          "start": 517.105,
          "duration": 4.139,
          "text": "つぎは革命児なのだ!?チャンネル登録も、よろしくなのだ!"
        }
      ]
    }
  ],
